  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:0",
      "text": "Thanks Thanks for jumping on. Brightwater Logistics sent over their security questionnaire, and it's the long one, about 200 questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:1",
      "text": "I saw it. A lot of it maps to our SOC 2 answers, so maybe half is copy and paste."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:2",
      "text": "The other half is the data residency section. They want to know where backups live."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:3",
      "text": "Backups stay in the EU region for region for EU customers. I need to check whether Brightwater is set up as EU or US."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:4",
      "text": "They're headquartered in the US, but the pilot team sits in Rotterdam."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:5",
      "text": "Then I'll answer for both and flag it."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:6",
      "text": "Do Do we attach the pen test summary or just reference it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:7",
      "text": "Attach the summary letter not the full report that needs an NDA."
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:8",
      "text": "We have a mutual NDA with them already I'll double check it covers security documents"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:9",
      "text": "Okay timing their procurement lead said they need it back next Friday"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:10",
      "text": "Next Friday is fine I can block out time for it"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:11",
      "text": "Great so Kwame owns the questionnaire back to them next Friday"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:12",
      "text": "And I'll do the legal and insurance sections those are mine anyway I'll pass them to Kwame to merge in"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:13",
      "text": "Works put them in the shared folder folder not email"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:14",
      "text": "I'll let their procurement lead know it's in progress"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:15",
      "text": "Do they want it in their portal or as a spreadsheet"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:16",
      "text": "Spreadsheet they said the portal is being replaced"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:17",
      "text": "Good the portal versions always break always break our formatting"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:18",
      "text": "One question on insurance do they want the certificate itself or just the coverage amounts"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:19",
      "text": "I'll ask when I write to procurement"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:20",
      "text": "Thanks"
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-deadline-next-friday:seg:21",
      "text": "That's it from me thanks both"
    }
  ],
